@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Employee
participant "System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : asks for the list of locomotives
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows the list of locomotives
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects the pretended locomotive to be bought
    activate System

        System --> Employee : requests confirmation
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms the purchase
    activate System

        System --> Employee : buys the locomotive and displays operation success
    deactivate System
@enduml